{"audio": "public/audio/gp34-presupuesto.mp3", "duracion": 63.164082, "escenas": [{"ini": 0.06, "fin": 3.18, "texto": "Carmen pregunta: «¿Cuánto dinero necesito tener y cuándo?»", "palabras": [{"w": "Carmen", "ini": 0.06, "fin": 0.34}, {"w": "pregunta:", "ini": 0.44, "fin": 0.7}, {"w": "«¿Cuánto", "ini": 0.78, "fin": 1.06}, {"w": "dinero", "ini": 1.14, "fin": 1.44}, {"w": "necesito", "ini": 1.5, "fin": 2.06}, {"w": "tener", "ini": 2.16, "fin": 2.46}, {"w": "y", "ini": 2.7, "fin": 2.74}, {"w": "cuándo?»", "ini": 2.84, "fin": 3.18}]}, {"ini": 4.12, "fin": 7.76, "texto": "Pía no puede darle solo un número: necesita un presupuesto.", "palabras": [{"w": "Pía", "ini": 4.12, "fin": 4.3}, {"w": "no", "ini": 4.36, "fin": 4.44}, {"w": "puede", "ini": 4.52, "fin": 4.76}, {"w": "darle", "ini": 4.82, "fin": 5.1}, {"w": "solo", "ini": 5.24, "fin": 5.46}, {"w": "un", "ini": 5.52, "fin": 5.6}, {"w": "número:", "ini": 5.62, "fin": 5.9}, {"w": "necesita", "ini": 6.24, "fin": 6.88}, {"w": "un", "ini": 6.94, "fin": 7.04}, {"w": "presupuesto.", "ini": 7.08, "fin": 7.76}]}, {"ini": 8.5, "fin": 17, "texto": "Determinar el presupuesto es sumar los costos estimados de las actividades o paquetes de trabajo para establecer una línea base de costos autorizada.", "palabras": [{"w": "Determinar", "ini": 8.5, "fin": 8.96}, {"w": "el", "ini": 9, "fin": 9.06}, {"w": "presupuesto", "ini": 9.1, "fin": 9.74}, {"w": "es", "ini": 10.06, "fin": 10.14}, {"w": "sumar", "ini": 10.18, "fin": 10.44}, {"w": "los", "ini": 10.48, "fin": 10.62}, {"w": "costos", "ini": 10.7, "fin": 11.06}, {"w": "estimados", "ini": 11.12, "fin": 11.68}, {"w": "de", "ini": 11.72, "fin": 11.78}, {"w": "las", "ini": 11.82, "fin": 11.94}, {"w": "actividades", "ini": 11.98, "fin": 12.58}, {"w": "o", "ini": 12.62, "fin": 12.66}, {"w": "paquetes", "ini": 12.76, "fin": 13.24}, {"w": "de", "ini": 13.28, "fin": 13.34}, {"w": "trabajo", "ini": 13.4, "fin": 13.8}, {"w": "para", "ini": 14.2, "fin": 14.3}, {"w": "establecer", "ini": 14.34, "fin": 14.82}, {"w": "una", "ini": 14.88, "fin": 15}, {"w": "línea", "ini": 15.06, "fin": 15.34}, {"w": "base", "ini": 15.38, "fin": 15.66}, {"w": "de", "ini": 15.72, "fin": 15.78}, {"w": "costos", "ini": 15.86, "fin": 16.28}, {"w": "autorizada.", "ini": 16.34, "fin": 17}]}, {"ini": 17.78, "fin": 25.62, "texto": "Las actividades se suman en paquetes de trabajo; los paquetes, en cuentas de control; y las cuentas dan la línea base de costos.", "palabras": [{"w": "Las", "ini": 17.78, "fin": 17.9}, {"w": "actividades", "ini": 17.94, "fin": 18.54}, {"w": "se", "ini": 18.72, "fin": 18.8}, {"w": "suman", "ini": 18.88, "fin": 19.14}, {"w": "en", "ini": 19.16, "fin": 19.26}, {"w": "paquetes", "ini": 19.3, "fin": 19.8}, {"w": "de", "ini": 19.84, "fin": 19.92}, {"w": "trabajo;", "ini": 19.96, "fin": 20.38}, {"w": "los", "ini": 20.82, "fin": 20.96}, {"w": "paquetes,", "ini": 21.02, "fin": 21.52}, {"w": "en", "ini": 21.7, "fin": 21.82}, {"w": "cuentas", "ini": 21.86, "fin": 22.18}, {"w": "de", "ini": 22.22, "fin": 22.28}, {"w": "control;", "ini": 22.34, "fin": 22.72}, {"w": "y", "ini": 23.12, "fin": 23.16}, {"w": "las", "ini": 23.2, "fin": 23.32}, {"w": "cuentas", "ini": 23.4, "fin": 23.8}, {"w": "dan", "ini": 24, "fin": 24.16}, {"w": "la", "ini": 24.2, "fin": 24.28}, {"w": "línea", "ini": 24.36, "fin": 24.68}, {"w": "base", "ini": 24.72, "fin": 24.98}, {"w": "de", "ini": 25.02, "fin": 25.08}, {"w": "costos.", "ini": 25.16, "fin": 25.62}]}, {"ini": 26.38, "fin": 29.42, "texto": "En cada nivel entran sus reservas para contingencias.", "palabras": [{"w": "En", "ini": 26.38, "fin": 26.44}, {"w": "cada", "ini": 26.5, "fin": 26.68}, {"w": "nivel", "ini": 26.74, "fin": 27.04}, {"w": "entran", "ini": 27.3, "fin": 27.58}, {"w": "sus", "ini": 27.62, "fin": 27.8}, {"w": "reservas", "ini": 27.86, "fin": 28.36}, {"w": "para", "ini": 28.42, "fin": 28.58}, {"w": "contingencias.", "ini": 28.64, "fin": 29.42}]}, {"ini": 29.96, "fin": 35.2, "texto": "Es la versión aprobada del presupuesto en el tiempo, y solo cambia con control formal de cambios.", "palabras": [{"w": "Es", "ini": 29.96, "fin": 30.08}, {"w": "la", "ini": 30.12, "fin": 30.18}, {"w": "versión", "ini": 30.24, "fin": 30.56}, {"w": "aprobada", "ini": 30.6, "fin": 31.06}, {"w": "del", "ini": 31.12, "fin": 31.22}, {"w": "presupuesto", "ini": 31.28, "fin": 31.86}, {"w": "en", "ini": 31.88, "fin": 31.94}, {"w": "el", "ini": 31.96, "fin": 32.04}, {"w": "tiempo,", "ini": 32.12, "fin": 32.44}, {"w": "y", "ini": 32.82, "fin": 32.86}, {"w": "solo", "ini": 32.94, "fin": 33.14}, {"w": "cambia", "ini": 33.24, "fin": 33.56}, {"w": "con", "ini": 33.64, "fin": 33.76}, {"w": "control", "ini": 33.8, "fin": 34.18}, {"w": "formal", "ini": 34.26, "fin": 34.58}, {"w": "de", "ini": 34.62, "fin": 34.68}, {"w": "cambios.", "ini": 34.78, "fin": 35.2}]}, {"ini": 35.98, "fin": 39.42, "texto": "Repartida en el tiempo, suele dibujarse como una curva en S.", "palabras": [{"w": "Repartida", "ini": 35.98, "fin": 36.46}, {"w": "en", "ini": 36.5, "fin": 36.56}, {"w": "el", "ini": 36.6, "fin": 36.66}, {"w": "tiempo,", "ini": 36.74, "fin": 37.08}, {"w": "suele", "ini": 37.26, "fin": 37.48}, {"w": "dibujarse", "ini": 37.52, "fin": 38.06}, {"w": "como", "ini": 38.16, "fin": 38.36}, {"w": "una", "ini": 38.42, "fin": 38.56}, {"w": "curva", "ini": 38.66, "fin": 39.04}, {"w": "en", "ini": 39.1, "fin": 39.2}, {"w": "S.", "ini": 39.38, "fin": 39.42}]}, {"ini": 40.08, "fin": 46.66, "texto": "Aparte queda la reserva de gestión, para trabajo no previsto dentro del alcance: lo que nadie vio venir.", "palabras": [{"w": "Aparte", "ini": 40.08, "fin": 40.52}, {"w": "queda", "ini": 40.68, "fin": 40.86}, {"w": "la", "ini": 40.92, "fin": 41}, {"w": "reserva", "ini": 41.06, "fin": 41.42}, {"w": "de", "ini": 41.44, "fin": 41.52}, {"w": "gestión,", "ini": 41.56, "fin": 42.02}, {"w": "para", "ini": 42.34, "fin": 42.48}, {"w": "trabajo", "ini": 42.54, "fin": 42.92}, {"w": "no", "ini": 43.04, "fin": 43.14}, {"w": "previsto", "ini": 43.24, "fin": 43.74}, {"w"